    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyo bwe byawa, abandi ku bakulembeze ab'abantu Abaisiraeli baidha ye ndi, bankoba bati: “Bakabona, n'Abalevi, n'Abaisiraeli abandi, bakaali n'enkolagana n'abantu ab'omu biketezo bino mwe tuli. Bakola ebintu ebyenhinhalwa ng'oti n'Abakanaani, n'Abahitti, n'Abaperizzi, n'Abayebusi, n'Abammoni, n'Abamoabu, n'Abamisiri, n'Abamori bye bakola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisiraeli abo abantu ba Katonda abatukuvu baayonooneka, kuba beene ni batabane baibwe bafuna abakazi abamaghanga agandi. Aye ate abakungu n'abakulembeze, n'abasinze kwonooneka mu nsambo eyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe nawulira ekyo naakanulamu ebivaalo byange olw'okunakughala, neemaanhuula enviiri ku mutwe ni ku kirevu, era naatyama ghansi nga nsobeirwa inho mu nnaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho abo boonaboona abaalumirwa ebyo Katonda wa Isiraeli bye yayogera ku kibi ekyo abo abaira okuva mu bunhage kye baakola, baidha baaneetooloola agho ghe nali ntyaime nga nsobeirwa inho mu nnaku. Baabaagho okutuusa ku kiseera eky'okughaayo ekigheebwayo ekyeigulo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekiseera eky'okughaayo omusengo ogw'eigulo bwe kyatuuka, naasituka ghe nali ntyaime nga ndi kusiiba era nga nkaali mu bivaalo byange ebikanufu. Naakuba amakiryaivu era naayandhululiza eri Musengwa Katonda wange emikono nga nkoba nti: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wo Katonda wange, nswaire inho era ensoni dhiri kungema okusitula amaiso ninge y'oli, iwe Katonda wange kuba ebibi byaife byebunze emungo etusinga n'obuleeyi, n'emisango gyaife gyebunga emungo etuuka ni ku igulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okuviira irala ku biseera bya badhaadha baife okutuusa ni ye buli eno, tukola inho ebibi. Era olw'ebibi byaife, ife, n'ebya bakyabazinga baife, n'ebya bakabona baife, tubairenga tugheebwayo mu ngalo dha bakyabazinga abamaghanga agandi, baatwitira mu ntalo, baatutwala mu bunhage, baatunhagaku ebyaife, era twaswala nga bwe tuli buti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye mperaano mu kiseera ekitono kiti, Musengwa Katonda waife atwoleike ekivunika, yaaleetera abandi ku ife okuwonagho era yaatugha okuba abagumu mu kifo kye kino ekitukuvu. Olwo Katonda waife oyo yaatuwonia obwiru, yaatugha obulamu obuyaaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tuli bairu, aye era Katonda waife tatulekuliire agho mu bwiru bwaife. Atwoleike nga bw'atugonza obutalekera, yaaleetera bakyabazinga b'e Perusia okutugonza, baatulekagho nga tukaali balamu. Olwo tusobole okuzimbira Katonda waife oyo eisinzizo lye eryali lyonooneibwa, era atukuumenga ng'atuwonia abazigu mu Buyudaaya ni mu Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wo Katonda waife, mperaano tunaakoba ki ng'ebyo byonabyona bimaze okubaagho? Tuviire ku biragiro byo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bye watugha ng'obita mu bagheereza bo abalanzi, ng'otukoba oti, ‘Ensi ye muli kwingiramu okutwala ebe eyaimwe, ti nongoofu naire. N'abantu baamu tiibalongoofu, kuba baagyonoona n'ebibi ebyenhinhalwa bye bagikoleramu okuva y'eva okutuuka y'ekanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbeeni mutaganhanga baghala baimwe kubayira batabane baibwe, waire okuganha batabane baimwe okubayiza baghala baibwe. Era mutabendezanga miraala oba okukulankulana, olwo musobole okuba ab'amaani n'okulya ebirungi eby'ensi eyo era mugirekere abaana baimwe ng'obusika bwaibwe obw'olubeerera.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.34.11+EXO.34.12+EXO.34.13+EXO.34.14+EXO.34.15+EXO.34.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 34:11-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.7.1+DEU.7.2+DEU.7.3+DEU.7.4+DEU.7.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ma 7:1-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye waire ng'ebyo byonabyona bitutuuseeku olw'ebikolwa byaife ebibi, n'olw'omusango omukologho ogutuliku, tubona nga iwe Katonda waife watugha ekibonerezo kitono inho ku ekyo ebibi byaife kye byali bigwaniire kuba watulekagho ife abaawonagho nga tuli bangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale tughanga tutya okwiramu okudheemera ekiragiro kyo ni tufumbiraganwa n'abantu abo abakola ebintu ebyo ebyenhinhalwa? Leero tolitusungughalira n'otuzikiriza ni ghabulagho awonagho naire omulala ati? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wo Musengwa Katonda wa Isiraeli, iwe osala mu butuufu, aye watusaasira twawonagho okutuusa ni mperaano. Bona, tuli ghano mu maiso go nga tuliku omusango, ate nga titugwaniire na kwemerera mu maiso go olw'omusango ogwo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
